   "finding": "TOV_FORCE lifts in a 4-game sample shrank about 50% or more under re-route and PT-shift controls (for example ORL +8.4 to +3.7pp). The record states net lift is model-implied rather than observed, and the counter-channel check was often an additive surrogate at n<10."
