 ],
 "evidence_establishes": [
  "The project has built PBP-derived PNR and PULL_UP possession labels for 30 teams and several seasons, and these labels have been calibrated (FAM:SF-APPM-058, FAM:SF-APPS-012).",
  "Defensive play-type splits by team and by regular season versus playoffs are computable at roughly 30 units with minimum-cell rules of 30 possessions (FAM:SF-APPS-012).",
